start by making sure

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:49.250
that it works as I expect
with a simple go run.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.810
So it looks pretty good.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.650
And at this point, I need to
containerize my Go application

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:56.690
so that I can deploy
to Kubernetes later.

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.990
So I have this
Docker file, and I'm

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:01.180
going to build my container
with a Docker build.

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:05.860
Cool.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.240
