00:02:54.728 --> 00:02:56.020
And then I would push my image.

00:02:56.020 --> 00:03:00.250
And the next thing I need
to do is patch my YAML file.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.980
DAVID GAGEOT: That's a super
