00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.260
Fetching YAML files.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:13.220
PRIYA WADHWA: And then
reapply my new pod.yaml spec.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:18.485
And if we check the logs,
it looks pretty good.

00:03:18.485 --> 00:03:20.735
DAVID GAGEOT: That's a lot
