00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:30.330
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.570
Even the smallest code
change requires a ton

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:35.010
of commands in my terminal.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:38.480
I have to rebuild my image,
remember to tag it differently,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.980
push my image, patch my
YAML with the new tag,

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:45.150
run a kubectl apply, and then
verify that the changes I made

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.490
are actually what
I wanted to see.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.100
And any error at any
point in the cycle

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:54.990
